tests/unit/B71SetupDeviceFix.verify.js (moi, 42 PASS) - toan bo checklist 10 muc de bai.
tests/unit/B70SetupDeviceAudit.verify.js - cap nhat 3 assertion da loi thoi (Finding 1 va
